{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04494","headline":"南山家园林木交映盛夏五月幽然清凉独坐思远率成十韵 · 陈子昂","name":"南山家园林木交映盛夏五月幽然清凉独坐思远率成十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寥守寒巷，幽独卧空林。\n松竹生虚白，阶庭横古今。\n郁蒸炎夏晚，栋宇閟清阴。\n轩窗交紫霭，檐户对苍岑。\n凤蕴仙人籙，鸾歌素女琴。\n忘机委人代，闭牖察天心。\n蛱蝶怜红药，蜻蜓爱碧浔。\n坐观万象化，方见百年侵。\n扰扰将何息，青青长苦吟。\n愿随白云驾，龙鹤相招寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}